  remediation: ['Growing crops is ______ farming.', 'Rearing animals is ______ farming.', 'Farming for sale is ______ farming.'],
  remediationAnswers: '1. arable 2. pastoral 3. commercial',
  homework: 'Classify three farms of your area as intensive or extensive and justify.',
  hwAnswer: 'Example: onion gardens by the Benue – intensive (much labour and water on small plots); cotton fields – semi-intensive; cattle herding – extensive (large areas, few inputs).',
